{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nyanzou never cleans up after playtime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Kumakichi tells him to, Nyanzou heads outside to play without cleaning anything up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Filled with rage, Kumakichi decides in his heart to destroy everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy, destroy, and destroy them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kumakichi\u2019s destruction action game is here and now available  in full DX glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From Kumakichi's Birth \u2606 Destruction God to even more in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Way more stages in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online multiplayer battles in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All-new ultimate moves in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With full voice acting and more content in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Options to customize characters in DX</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come experience DX destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*The PC version does not have online battle functionality. Instead, you can play single player on maps that are used in online battles on other platforms.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3635960?t=1743853142","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3635960?t=1743853142","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635960/2bf473fd56be71d121ca2bfb86bdb47c41918310/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743853142","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635960/2bf473fd56be71d121ca2bfb86bdb47c41918310/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743853142","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"id